ibuting sponsor under Section 4069 of ERISA.","section":"","block":224,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-336485","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-06","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001673358","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1673358/000119312526336485/yumc-ex10_1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/ac7cf68fb4275fafadd24a7c710bf9b7c082870942ee0ac1df702e92e0b3c652.bin","sha256":"ac7cf68fb4275fafadd24a7c710bf9b7c082870942ee0ac1df702e92e0b3c652"}},{"id":"f1db58213cb6da9bd3f9e89de966450082c8169684ab8db59253a5b3883ecf35","quote":"“Reference Banks” means the principal Hong Kong offices of Citibank N.A. and the principal Hong Kong office of two other banks as appointed by the Administrative Agent and the Borrower.","context":"and if that rate is less than 0.00%, the Reference Bank Rate will be deemed to be 0.00%.","section":"","block":244,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-336485","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-08-06","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001673358","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1673358/000119312526336485/yumc-ex10_1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/ac7cf68fb4275fafadd24a7c710bf9b7c082870942ee0ac1df702e92e0b3c652.bin","sha256":"ac7cf68fb4275fafadd24a7c710bf9b7c082870942ee0ac1df702e92e0b3c652"}},{"id":"f966e5a5bb7b83a35a14232fcb8a6d565c117fcfec3fbed6fe0b5a8c8e56c4b0","quote":"Borrower’s or any Subsidiary’s records; provided that (x) if such report of the Independent Auditor is a combined report (that is, one report containing an opinion on such consolidated financial statements, an opinion on internal controls over financial reporting and an opinion on management’s assessment of internal controls over financial reporting), then such report may include a qualification or limitation relating to the Borrower’s system of internal controls 